                                                "sense_id": "c9fd1273-f821-3ce1-ab6b-a5599d89c852",
                                                "text": "Beyond Gori the traveller will pass Mizkettra, the ancient residence of the kings of Georgia. It is now a ruin, still however containing 2 churches of some sanctity, in one of which the kings of Georgia were crowned, and where to the present day the bishops of Tiflis are consecrated."
                                            }
